="180" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">2</text><text x="144.6" y="150" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">−2</text><text x="192" y="91.8" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="end">4</text><text x="208" y="240.2" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="start">−4</text><text x="327.4" y="244" font-size="16" fill="#d70217" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">y</tspan> = <tspan font-style="italic">x</tspan> + 4/<tspan font-style="italic">x</tspan></text><text x="392" y="182" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="end"><tspan font-style="italic">x</tspan></text><text x="214" y="18" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="start"><tspan font-style="italic">y</tspan></text></svg>', '0 0 400 330', 'График y = x + 4/x. Правая ветвь в первой четверти имеет самую низкую точку (2, 4). Левая ветвь в третьей четверти имеет самую высокую точку (−2, −4). Между горизонтальными пунктирными линиями y = −4 и y = 4 графика нет.', 'y = x + 4/x графиги. Биринчи чейректеги оң тармактын эң төмөнкү чекити (2, 4). Үчүнчү чейректеги сол тармактын эң жогорку чекити (−2, −4). y = −4 жана y = 4 горизонталдык пунктир сызыктардын ортосунда график жок.', 'Graph of y = x + 4/x. The right branch in the first quadrant has its lowest point at (2, 4); the left branch in the third quadrant has its highest point at (-2, -4). There is no graph between the dashed horizontal lines y = -4 and y = 4.', '07d77c4215cef82f5c6fac47099e2c2a4ac53ac41cf5b180a552726376ce1e91'),
  ('0f9ec044-040e-5e0f-8b01-143b9404054a', 'afbc61ca-e798-54ac-8239-1569327cebf1', 'domain-range-graph', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 270" width="400" height="270" font-family="Golos Text, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif"><title>Graph of y = sqrt(4 - x^2) with its domain on the x-axis and its range on the y-axis</title><rect width="400" height="270" rx="12" fill="#ffffff"/><line x1="50" y1="235" x2="50" y2="45" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="100" y1="235" x2="100" y2="45" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="150" y1="235" x2="150" y2="45" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="250" y1="235" x2="250" y2="45" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="300" y1="235" x2="300" y2="45" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="350" y1="235" x2="350" y2="45" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="25" y1="140" x2="375" y2="140" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="25" y1="90" x2="375" y2="90" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="15" y1="190" x2="385" y2="190" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="393,190 383,185 383,195" fill="#191714"/><line x1="200" y1="215" x2="200" y2="37.5" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="200,29.5 195,39.5 205,39.5" fill="#191714"/><path d="M300,190 L299.9,185.1 L299.5,180.2 L298.9,175.3 L298.1,170.5 L297,165.7 L295.7,161 L294.2,156.3 L292.4,151.7 L290.4,147.2 L288.2,142.9 L285.8,138.6 L283.1,134.4 L280.3,130.4 L277.3,126.6 L274.1,122.8 L270.7,119.3 L267.2,115.9 L263.4,112.7 L259.6,109.7 L255.6,106.9 L251.4,104.2 L247.1,101.8 L242.8,99.6 L238.3,97.6 L233.7,95.8 L229,94.3 L224.3,93 L219.5,91.9 L214.7,91.1 L209.8,90.5 L204.9,90.1 L200,90 L195.1,90.1 L190.2,90.5 L185.3,91.1 L180.5,91.9 L175.7,93 L171,94.3 L166.3,95.8 L161.7,97.6 L157.2,99.6 L152.9,101.8 L148.6,104.2 L144.4,106.9 L140.4,109.7 L136.6,112.7 L132.8,115.9 L129.3,119.3 L125.9,122.8 L122.7,126.6 L119.7,130.4 L116.9,134.4 L114.2,138.6 L111.8,142.9 L109.6,147.2 L107.6,151.7 L105.8,156.3 L104.3,161 L103,165.7 L101.9,170.5 L101.1,175.3 L100.5,180.2 L100.1,185.1 L100,190" fill="none" stroke="#d70217" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="100" y1="190" x2="300" y2="190" stroke="#d70217" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="200" y1="190" x2="200" y2="90" stroke="#177245" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="260" y1="110" x2="260" y2="190" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="3 4"/><line x1="260" y1="110" x2="200" y2="110" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="3 4"/><circle cx="100" cy="190" r="5" fill="#191714"/><circle cx="300" cy="190" r="5" fill="#191714"/><circle cx="260" cy="110" r="5" fill="#191714"/><text x="100" y="212" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">−2</text><text x="300" y="212" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">2</text><text x="190" y="83" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="end">2</text><text x="200" y="238" font-size="15" fill="#d70217" text-anchor="middle">[−2, 2]</text><text x="188" y="145" font-size="15" fill="#177245" text-anchor="end">[0, 2]</text><text x="370" y="66" font-size="16" fill="#d70217" text-anchor="end"><tspan font-style="italic">y</tspan> = √(4 − <tspan font-style="italic">x</tspan>²)</text><text x="386" y="212" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="end"><tspan font-style="italic">x</tspan></text><text x="214" y="38" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="start"><tspan font-style="italic">y</tspan></text></svg>', '0 0 400 270', 'График y = √(4 − x²): верхняя половина окружности радиуса 2 с центром в начале координат. Красный отрезок на оси x от −2 до 2 показывает область определения. Зелёный отрезок на оси y от 0 до 2 показывает множество значений. Пунктиры от точки (1.2, 1.6) идут к обеим осям.', 'y = √(4 − x²) графиги: координаталар башталышында борбору бар, радиусу 2 болгон айлананын жогорку жарымы. x огундагы −2ден 2ге чейинки кызыл кесинди аныкталуу областын көрсөтөт. y огундагы 0дөн 2ге чейинки жашыл кесинди маанилер областын көрсөтөт. (1.2, 1.6) чекитинен эки окко пунктир сызыктар түшүрүлгөн.', 'Graph of y = sqrt(4 - x^2), the upper half of the circle of radius 2 centered at the origin. A red segment on the x-axis from -2 to 2 marks the domain; a green segment on the y-axis from 0 to 2 marks the range. Dashed lines run from the point (1.2, 1.6) to both axes.', '6bb7bf811e60bd3c9cde2b2ee9683211fb384e7224c3fbcc2cd3bdd305f61643'),
