oke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/><line x1="357.3" y1="43.8" x2="357.3" y2="71.4" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/><text x="250.7" y="40.8" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">T</tspan> = π</text><text x="80.7" y="143.9" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="end"><tspan font-style="italic">x</tspan><tspan dy="4" font-size="13">0</tspan></text><text x="202.7" y="274.7" font-size="15" fill="#d70217" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">y</tspan> = 2 sin(2<tspan font-style="italic">x</tspan> + π/2)</text></svg>', '0 0 400 300', 'График y = 2 sin(2x + π/2) на отрезке от −π/2 до π. Кривая начинается в точке (−π/2, −2), поднимается через полую точку x₀ = −π/4 на оси x, достигает максимума 2 в точке x = 0, пересекает ось в π/4, достигает минимума −2 в π/2, снова пересекает ось в 3π/4 и приходит в максимум в точке (π, 2). Горизонтальная двусторонняя стрелка от 0 до π подписана T = π.', 'y = 2 sin(2x + π/2) графиги, −π/2 ден π ге чейинки кесиндиде. Ийри сызык (−π/2, −2) чекитинен башталат, x огундагы бош чекит x₀ = −π/4 аркылуу көтөрүлөт, x = 0 болгондо 2 максимумуна жетет, π/4 тө окту кесет, π/2 де −2 минимумуна жетет, 3π/4 те кайра окту кесет жана (π, 2) чекитинде максимумга келет. 0 дөн π ге чейинки горизонталдык эки жактуу жебе T = π деп белгиленген.', 'Graph of y = 2 sin(2x + pi/2) from -pi/2 to pi: it rises through the hollow point x0 = -pi/4, has a maximum 2 at x = 0, a minimum -2 at pi/2 and a maximum again at pi; a double arrow from 0 to pi is labelled T = pi.', 'f4a50af866fd46362620ae5a784f80c2f9710c274b7c79db4987edbabcc80414'),
  ('6b2b7edb-0ff4-50a0-86a6-622b3c5e5acf', 'afbc61ca-e798-54ac-8239-1569327cebf1', 'seq-arithmetic-staircase', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 330" width="400" height="330" font-family="Golos Text, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif"><title>Bars of heights 2, 5, 8, 11, 14 for an arithmetic sequence with difference 3 and the average height 8</title><rect width="400" height="330" rx="12" fill="#ffffff"/><line x1="26" y1="266" x2="354" y2="266" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><rect x="36" y="236" width="50" height="30" fill="#e4dfd7" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><text x="61" y="228" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">2</text><text x="61" y="287" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">a</tspan><tspan dy="4" font-size="13">1</tspan></text><rect x="100" y="191" width="50" height="75" fill="#e4dfd7" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><text x="125" y="183" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">5</text><text x="125" y="287" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">a</tspan><tspan dy="4" font-size="13">2</tspan></text><rect x="164" y="146" width="50" height="120" fill="#e4dfd7" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><text x="189" y="138" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">8</text><text x="189" y="287" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">a</tspan><tspan dy="4" font-size="13">3</tspan></text><rect x="228" y="101" width="50" height="165" fill="#e4dfd7" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><text x="253" y="93" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">11</text><text x="253" y="287" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">a</tspan><tspan dy="4" font-size="13">4</tspan></text><rect x="292" y="56" width="50" height="210" fill="#e4dfd7" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><text x="317" y="48" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">14</text><text x="317" y="287" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">a</tspan><tspan dy="4" font-size="13">5</tspan></text><line x1="26" y1="146" x2="354" y2="146" stroke="#d70217" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="6 4"/><text x="30" y="137" font-size="14" fill="#d70217" text-anchor="start">(2 + 14)/2 = 8</text><text x="36" y="40" font-size="16" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="start"><tspan font-style="italic">d</tspan> = 3</text><text x="200" y="318" font-size="16" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">S</tspan><tspan dy="4" font-size="13">5</tspan><tspan dy="-4" dx="4">= 5 · 8 = 40</tspan></text></svg>', '0 0 400 330', 'Пять столбиков растущей высоты, подписанные a₁, a₂, a₃, a₄, a₅ со значениями 2, 5, 8, 11, 14. Рядом надпись d = 3. Красная пунктирная горизонтальная линия на высоте 8 подписана (2 + 14)/2 = 8. Внизу надпись S₅ = 5 · 8 = 40.', 'Бийиктиги өсүп бараткан беш мамыча, a₁, a₂, a₃, a₄, a₅ деп белгиленген, маанилери 2, 5, 8, 11, 14. Жанында d = 3 жазуусу. 8 бийиктиктеги кызыл пунктир горизонталдык сызык (2 + 14)/2 = 8 деп белгиленген. Төмөндө S₅ = 5 · 8 = 40 жазуусу.', 'Five bars of increasing height labelled a1 to a5 with values 2, 5, 8, 11, 14, the note d = 3, a red dashed horizontal line at height 8 labelled (2 + 14)/2 = 8, and below the bars S5 = 5 times 8 = 40.', '6f0ded7fdb6823bcd38d609c0a7c0ceecfac17e8e0658070836e12d939a8c349'),
  ('87e8ae28-b04e-5dbf-8956-780dd0a82f77', 'afbc61ca-e798-54ac-8239-1569327cebf1', 'geo-seq-ratio', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 372" width="400" height="372" font-family="Golos Text, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif"><title>Bars of the first five terms for q = 2, q = 1/2 and q = -2</title><rect width="400" height="372" rx="12" fill="#ffffff"/><text x="22" y="74" font-size="16" fill="#191714" text-anchor="start" font-weight="600"><tspan font-style="italic">q</tspan> = 2</text><line x1="100" y1="100" x2="376" y2="100" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><rect x="110" y="96.4" width="36" height="3.6" fill="#d70217"/><text x="128" y="90.4" font-size="14" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">1</text><rect x="166" y="92.8" width="36" height="7.2" fill="#d70217"/><text x="184" y="86.8" font-size="14" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">2</text><rect x="222" y="85.6" width="36" height="14.4" fill="#d70217"/><text x="240" y="79.6" font-size="14" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">4</text><rect x="278" y="71.2" width="36" height="28.8" fill="#d70217"/><text x="296" y="65.2" font-size="14" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">8</text><rect x="334" y="42.4" width="36" height="57.6" fill="#d70217"/><text x="352" y="36.4" font-size="14" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">16</text><text x="22" y="174" font-size="16" fill="#191714" text-anchor="start" font-weight="600"><tspan font-style="italic">q</tspan> = 1/2</text><line x1="100" y1="200" x2="376" y2="200" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><rect x="110" y="142.4" width="36" height="57.6" fill="#d70217"/><text x="128" y="136.4" font-size="14" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">16</text><rect x="166" y="171.2" width="36" height="28.8" fill="#d70217"/><text x="184" y="165.2" font-size="14" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">8</text><rect x="222" y="185.6" width="36" height="14.4" fill="#d70217"/><text x="240" y="179.6" font-size="14" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">4</text><rect x="278" y="192.8" width="36" height="7.2" fill="#d70217"/><text x="296" y="186.8" font-size="14" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">2</text><rect x="334" y="196.4" width="36" height="3.6" fill="#d70217"/><text x="352" y="190.4" font-size="14" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">1</text><text x="22" y="266" font-size="16" fill="#191714" text-anchor="start" font-weight="600"><tspan font-style="italic">q</tspan> = −2</text><line x1="100" y1="292" x2="376" y2="292" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><rect x="110" y="288.4" width="36" height="3.6" fill="#d70217"/><text x="128" y="282.4" font-size="14" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">1</text><rect x="166" y="292" width="36" height="7.2" fill="#191714"/><text x="184" y="316.2" font-size="14" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">−2</text><rect x="222" y="277.6" width="36" height="14.4" fill="#d70217"/><text x="240" y="271.6" font-size="14" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">4</text><rect x="278" y="292" width="36" height="28.8" fill="#191714"/><text x="296" y="337.8" font-size="14" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">−8</text><rect x="334" y="234.4" width="36" height="57.6" fill="#d70217"/><text x="352" y="228.4" font-size="14" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">16</text><text x="22" y="362" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="start"><tspan font-style="italic">n</tspan></text><text x="128" y="362" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">1</text><text x="184" y="362" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">2</text><text x="240" y="362" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">3</text><text x="296" y="362" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">4</text><text x="352" y="362" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">5</text></svg>', '0 0 400 372', 'Три ряда столбиков для первых пяти членов. При q = 2 члены 1, 2, 4, 8, 16 растут. При q = 1/2 члены 16, 8, 4, 2, 1 убывают. При q = −2 члены 1, −2, 4, −8, 16 чередуют знаки, а их модули растут.', 'Алгачкы беш мүчөнүн үч катар тилкеси. q = 2 болгондо 1, 2, 4, 8, 16 мүчөлөрү өсөт. q = 1/2 болгондо 16, 8, 4, 2, 1 мүчөлөрү кемийт. q = −2 болгондо 1, −2, 4, −8, 16 мүчөлөрүнүн белгилери алмашат, модулдары өсөт.', 'Three rows of bars for the first five terms. For q = 2 the terms 1, 2, 4, 8, 16 grow; for q = 1/2 the terms 16, 8, 4, 2, 1 shrink; for q = -2 the terms 1, -2, 4, -8, 16 alternate in sign while their absolute values grow.', '8cd8c2cab99ef041071b3740048b0776c03720ccfeba8ef636e48486b8824d8e'),
