равна 5. Треугольник PDF закрашен светло.', 'Оңго ачык y² = 4x параболасы: x огунда F фокусу жана чокунун сол жагында пунктир l директрисасы бар. Параболадагы P чекити x огунан жогору жатат. P чекитинен директрисага PD перпендикуляры түшүрүлгөн, PD узундугу 5ке барабар. PDF үч бурчтугу ачык түс менен боёлгон.', 'Parabola y^2 = 4x opening to the right, with focus F on the x-axis and a dashed directrix l to the left of the vertex. The point P lies on the parabola above the x-axis, PD is perpendicular to l with |PD| = 5, and triangle PDF is lightly shaded.', 'a6958ca1b2f7cbe8588ea76bf61aef9fffcb2045c55997489e392e2ee35a23e3'),
  ('5b577679-4373-577c-8faa-7b44b6d6e43f', 'afbc61ca-e798-54ac-8239-1569327cebf1', 'parabola-focus-directrix', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 300" width="400" height="300" font-family="Golos Text, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif"><title>Parabola y^2 = 8x with focus F(2, 0), directrix x = -2 and the point P(2, 4)</title><rect width="400" height="300" rx="12" fill="#ffffff"/><line x1="113" y1="285.2" x2="113" y2="14.8" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-dasharray="7 5" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="81.8" y1="150" x2="370.2" y2="150" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="378.2,150 369.2,154.5 369.2,145.5" fill="#191714"/><line x1="165" y1="290.4" x2="165" y2="17.6" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="165,9.6 169.5,18.6 160.5,18.6" fill="#191714"/><text x="374.2" y="174" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">x</tspan></text><text x="153" y="19.6" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">y</tspan></text><path d="M246.2,280 L243.6,277.8 L240.9,275.7 L238.3,273.5 L235.8,271.3 L233.3,269.2 L230.8,267 L228.4,264.8 L226,262.7 L223.7,260.5 L221.4,258.3 L219.2,256.2 L217,254 L214.9,251.8 L212.8,249.7 L210.7,247.5 L208.7,245.3 L206.7,243.2 L204.8,241 L202.9,238.8 L201.1,236.7 L199.3,234.5 L197.6,232.3 L195.9,230.2 L194.2,228 L192.6,225.8 L191.1,223.7 L189.6,221.5 L188.1,219.3 L186.7,217.2 L185.3,215 L184,212.8 L182.7,210.7 L181.5,208.5 L180.3,206.3 L179.1,204.2 L178,202 L176.9,199.8 L175.9,197.7 L175,195.5 L174,193.3 L173.1,191.2 L172.3,189 L171.5,186.8 L170.8,184.7 L170.1,182.5 L169.4,180.3 L168.8,178.2 L168.2,176 L167.7,173.8 L167.3,171.7 L166.8,169.5 L166.4,167.3 L166.1,165.2 L165.8,163 L165.6,160.8 L165.4,158.7 L165.2,156.5 L165.1,154.3 L165,152.2 L165,150 L165,147.8 L165.1,145.7 L165.2,143.5 L165.4,141.3 L165.6,139.2 L165.8,137 L166.1,134.8 L166.4,132.7 L166.8,13