,235.2 L306.8,235.4 L309,235.8 L311.3,236.2 L313.5,236.8 L315.8,237.4 L318,238.1 L320.3,239 L322.5,239.9 L324.8,240.9 L327,242 L329.3,243.3 L331.5,244.6 L333.8,246 L336.1,247.5 L338.3,249.1 L340.6,250.8 L342.8,252.6 L345.1,254.5 L347.3,256.5 L349.6,258.6 L351.8,260.8 L354.1,263.1 L356.3,265.5 L358.6,268 L360.8,270.6 L363.1,273.3 L365.3,276.1 L367.6,278.9" fill="none" stroke="#d70217" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="300" cy="261" r="4.5" fill="#191714"/><text x="314" y="266" font-size="14" fill="#191714" text-anchor="start"><tspan font-style="italic">F</tspan></text><text x="224.4" y="214" font-size="14" fill="#191714" text-anchor="end"><tspan font-style="italic">l</tspan></text><text x="300" y="326" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">x</tspan>² = −2<tspan font-style="italic">p</tspan><tspan font-style="italic">y</tspan></text></svg>', '0 0 400 340', 'Четыре параболы с вершиной в начале координат, у каждой отмечены фокус F и пунктирная директриса l. Парабола y² = 2px открыта вправо, y² = −2px открыта влево, x² = 2py открыта вверх, x² = −2py открыта вниз. Фокус всегда внутри параболы, директриса по другую сторону от вершины.', 'Чокусу координаталар башталышында болгон төрт парабола, ар биринде F фокусу жана пунктир l директрисасы белгиленген. y² = 2px параболасы оңго ачык, y² = −2px солго ачык, x² = 2py жогору ачык, x² = −2py төмөн ачык. Фокус дайыма параболанын ичинде, директриса чокунун карама-каршы тарабында.', 'Four parabolas with the vertex at the origin, each with its focus F and a dashed directrix l. y^2 = 2px opens right, y^2 = -2px opens left, x^2 = 2py opens up and x^2 = -2py opens down. The focus is always inside the curve and the directrix is on the other side of the vertex.', '4eba37631088dc7f7f28c78f04f4df78fc118c90d13da54e34209f0b6b2d5ba1'),
  ('637663b8-6861-5949-8075-f69ad5d2d8db', 'afbc61ca-e798-54ac-8239-1569327cebf1', 'item-vectors-rectangle', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 284" width="400" height="284" font-family="Golos Text, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif"><title>Rectangle ABCD with sides AB = 4 and BC = 3 and the diagonals drawn as arrows AC and BD</title><rect width="400" height="284" rx="12" fill="#ffffff"/><rect x="100" y="50" width="240" height="180" fill="none" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="100" y1="230" x2="332" y2="56" stroke="#d70217" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="340,50 334.5,61 327.9,52.2" fill="#d70217"/><line x1="340" y1="230" x2="108" y2="56" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="100,50 112.1,52.2 105.5,61" fill="#191714"/><circle cx="100" cy="230" r="4" fill="#191714"/><text x="86" y="252" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="end"><tspan font-style="italic">A</tspan></text><circle cx="340" cy="230" r="4" fill="#191714"/><text x="354" y="252" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="start"><tspan font-style="italic">B</tspan></text><circle cx="340" cy="50" r="4" fill="#191714"/><text x="354" y="42" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="start"><tspan font-style="italic">C</tspan></text><circle cx="100" cy="50" r="4" fill="#191714"/><text x="86" y="42" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="end"><tspan font-style="italic">D</tspan></text><text x="220" y="254" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">4</text><text x="352" y="145" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="start">3</text></svg>', '0 0 400 284', 'Прямоугольник ABCD: A внизу слева, B внизу справа, C вверху справа, D вверху слева. Сторона AB равна 4, сторона BC равна 3. Диагонали нарисованы стрелками: красная от A к C, чёрная от B к D.', 'ABCD тик бурчтугу: A төмөндө сол жакта, B төмөндө оң жакта, C жогоруда оң жакта, D жогоруда сол жакта. AB жагы 4кө, BC жагы 3кө барабар. Диагоналдар жебе менен тартылган: кызылы A дан C га, карасы B дан D га.', 'Rectangle ABCD with A at the bottom left, B bottom right, C top right and D top left. AB = 4 and BC = 3. The diagonals are drawn as arrows: red from A to C and black from B to D.', '8ccf36ce761df11ba441adf18e74a3a951bf9eff9a1451c689b1d927b45b231b'),
  ('efe9b039-070a-5d51-81ab-5c301c3e402f', 'afbc61ca-e798-54ac-8239-1569327cebf1', 'vectors-add', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" width="400" height="290" font-family="Golos Text, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif"><title>Vectors a = (3, 1), b = (1, 2) and their sum a + b = (4, 3) on a grid</title><rect width="400" height="290" rx="12" fill="#ffffff"/><line x1="60" y1="250" x2="60" y2="50" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="100" y1="250" x2="100" y2="50" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="140" y1="250" x2="140" y2="50" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="180" y1="250" x2="180" y2="50" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="220" y1="250" x2="220" y2="50" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="260" y1="250" x2="260" y2="50" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="300" y1="250" x2="300" y2="50" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="340" y1="250" x2="340" y2="50" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="380" y1="250" x2="380" y2="50" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="60" y1="250" x2="380" y2="250" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="60" y1="210" x2="380" y2="210" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="60" y1="170" x2="380" y2="170" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="60" y1="130" x2="380" y2="130" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="60" y1="90" x2="380" y2="90" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="60" y1="50" x2="380" y2="50" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="44" y1="250" x2="392" y2="250" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="400,250 391,254.5 391,245.5" fill="#191714"/><line x1="60" y1="266" x2="60" y2="34" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="60,26 64.5,35 55.5,35" fill="#191714"/><text x="396" y="274" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">x</tspan></text><text x="48" y="36" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">y</tspan></text><text x="100" y="270" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">1</text><text x="140" y="270" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">2</text><text x="180" y="270" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">3</text><text x="220" y="270" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">4</text><text x="260" y="270" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">5</text><text x="300" y="270" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">6</text><text x="340" y="270" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">7</text><text x="52" y="215" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="end">1</text><text x="52" y="175" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="end">2</text><text x="52" y="135" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="end">3</text><text x="52" y="95" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="end">4</text><text x="52" y="55" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="end">5</text><line x1="60" y1="250" x2="100" y2="170" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-dasharray="5 5" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="100" y1="170" x2="220" y2="130" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-dasharray="5 5" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="60" y1="250" x2="172.4" y2="212.5" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="180,210 172.9,217.1 170,208.6" fill="#191714"/><line x1="180" y1="210" x2="216.4" y2="137.2" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="220,130 220,140.1 212,136" fill="#191714"/><line x1="60" y1="250" x2="213.6" y2="134.8" stroke="#d70217" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="220,130 215.5,139 210.1,131.8" fill="#d70217"/><text x="118" y="220" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">a</tspan></text><text x="212" y="172" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="start"><tspan font-style="italic">b</tspan></text><text x="232" y="132" font-size="15" fill="#d70217" text-anchor="start"><tspan font-style="italic">a</tspan> + <tspan font-style="italic">b</tspan></text><text x="70" y="212" font-size="15" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="end"><tspan font-style="italic">b</tspan></text><text x="160" y="140" font-size="15" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">a</tspan></text><text x="250" y="44" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="start"><tspan font-style="italic">a</tspan> = (3, 1)</text><text x="250" y="68" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="start"><tspan font-style="italic">b</tspan> = (1, 2)</text><text x="250" y="92" font-size="15" fill="#d70217" text-anchor="start"><tspan font-style="italic">a</tspan> + <tspan font-style="italic">b</tspan> = (4, 3)</text></svg>', '0 0 400 290', 'Координатная сетка. Вектор a = (3, 1) идёт из начала координат. От его конца отложен вектор b = (1, 2), вместе они приводят в точку (4, 3). Красная стрелка из начала в эту точку это сумма a + b = (4, 3). Пунктир достраивает параллелограмм: вектор b от начала и вектор a от точки (1, 2).', 'Координаталык тор. a = (3, 1) вектору координаталар башталышынан чыгат. Анын учунан b = (1, 2) вектору коюлган, экөө бирге (4, 3) чекитине алып барат. Башталыштан ошол чекитке барган кызыл жебе a + b = (4, 3) суммасы. Пунктир параллелограммды толуктайт: башталыштан b вектору жана (1, 2) чекитинен a вектору.', 'A coordinate grid. Vector a = (3, 1) starts at the origin and vector b = (1, 2) is placed at its tip, arriving at (4, 3). The red arrow from the origin to (4, 3) is the sum a + b = (4, 3). Dashed sides complete the parallelogram.', '13e610d6723a2b3a0e2717e650a2180ae182f62aecccbeaa358ddfa21869a1fa'),
  ('260860d2-50de-52dc-8aa9-2942be8fddf1', 'afbc61ca-e798-54ac-8239-1569327cebf1', 'vectors-angle-sign', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 190" width="400" height="190" font-family="Golos Text, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif"><title>The sign of the dot product for an acute, a right and an obtuse angle between two vectors</title><rect width="400" height="190" rx="12" fill="#ffffff"/><line x1="24" y1="120" x2="96" y2="120" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="104,120 95,124.5 95,115.5" fill="#191714"/><line x1="24" y1="120" x2="69" y2="66.4" stroke="#d70217" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="74.1,60.2 71.8,70 64.9,64.3" fill="#d70217"/><text x="108" y="138" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">a</tspan></text><text x="82.1" y="52.2" font-size="15" fill="#d70217" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">b</tspan></text><path d="M50,120 L50,119.1 L49.9,118.1 L49.8,117.2 L49.7,116.2 L49.6,115.3 L49.4,114.4 L49.2,113.5 L48.9,112.5 L48.6,111.6 L48.3,110.8 L47.9,109.9 L47.6,109 L47.1,108.2 L46.7,107.3 L46.2,106.5 L45.7,105.7 L45.2,104.9 L44.6,104.2 L44,103.4 L43.4,102.7 L42.8,102 L42.1,101.3 L41.4,100.7 L40.7,100.1" fill="none" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/><text x="64" y="150" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">θ &lt; 90°</text><text x="64" y="174" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">a</tspan> · <tspan font-style="italic">b</tspan> &gt; 0</text><line x1="150" y1="120" x2="222" y2="120" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="230,120 221,124.5 221,115.5" fill="#191714"/><line x1="150" y1="120" x2="150" y2="50" stroke="#d70217" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="150,42 154.5,51 145.5,51" fill="#d70217"/><text x="234" y="138" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">a</tspan></text><text x="158" y="34" font-size="15" fill="#d70217" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">b</tspan></text><path d="M162,120 L162,108 L150,108" fill="none" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/><text x="190" y="150" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">θ = 90°</text><text x="190" y="174" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">a</tspan> · <tspan font-style="italic">b</tspan> = 0</text><line x1="300" y1="120" x2="372" y2="120" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="380,120 371,124.5 371,115.5" fill="#191714"/><line x1="300" y1="120" x2="255" y2="66.4" stroke="#d70217" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="249.9,60.2 259.1,64.3 252.2,70" fill="#d70217"/><text x="384" y="138" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">a</tspan></text><text x="241.9" y="52.2" font-size="15" fill="#d70217" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">b</tspan></text><path d="M326,120 L325.9,117.5 L325.5,115.1 L325,112.7 L324.2,110.4 L323.1,108.2 L321.9,106 L320.5,104 L318.9,102.2 L317.1,100.5 L315.2,98.9 L313.2,97.6 L311,96.4 L308.7,95.5 L306.4,94.8 L304,94.3 L301.5,94 L299.1,94 L296.6,94.2 L294.2,94.7 L291.8,95.3 L289.5,96.2 L287.3,97.3 L285.2,98.6 L283.3,100.1" fill="none" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/><text x="340" y="150" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">θ &gt; 90°</text><text x="340" y="174" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle"><tspan font-style="italic">a</tspan> · <tspan font-style="italic">b</tspan> &lt; 0</text></svg>', '0 0 400 190', 'Три пары векторов a и b из одной точки. Угол θ меньше 90°, скалярное произведение a · b больше 0. Угол θ равен 90°, отмечен прямой угол, a · b равно 0. Угол θ больше 90°, a · b меньше 0.', 'Бир чекиттен чыккан a жана b векторлорунун үч жуптугу. θ бурчу 90°тан кичине, a · b скалярдык көбөйтүндүсү 0дөн чоң. θ бурчу 90°ка барабар, тик бурч белгиленген, a · b нөлгө барабар. θ бурчу 90°тан чоң, a · b 0дөн кичине.', 'Three pairs of vectors a and b from one point. For an angle below 90 degrees the dot product a · b is positive; for a right angle it is zero; for an angle above 90 degrees it is negative.', 'eb3cf99118f76342cd892e56b1462e1aa8fa296d7310eabb562e1e67693aef1e'),
  ('888120b8-3561-5cf1-88b4-a604ee4a6228', 'afbc61ca-e798-54ac-8239-1569327cebf1', 'complex-plane', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 340" width="400" height="340" font-family="Golos Text, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif"><title>The complex plane with z = 3 + 4i, the number 3 - 4i and |z| = 5</title><rect width="400" height="340" rx="12" fill="#ffffff"/><line x1="38" y1="306" x2="38" y2="34" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="72" y1="306" x2="72" y2="34" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="106" y1="306" x2="106" y2="34" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="140" y1="306" x2="140" y2="34" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="174" y1="306" x2="174" y2="34" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="208" y1="306" x2="208" y2="34" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="242" y1="306" x2="242" y2="34" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="276" y1="306" x2="276" y2="34" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="310" y1="306" x2="310" y2="34" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="344" y1="306" x2="344" y2="34" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="38" y1="306" x2="344" y2="306" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="38" y1="272" x2="344" y2="272" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="38" y1="238" x2="344" y2="238" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="38" y1="204" x2="344" y2="204" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="38" y1="170" x2="344" y2="170" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="38" y1="136" x2="344" y2="136" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="38" y1="102" x2="344" y2="102" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="38" y1="68" x2="344" y2="68" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="38" y1="34" x2="344" y2="34" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="17.6" y1="170" x2="370" y2="170" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="378,170 369,174.5 369,165.5" fill="#191714"/><line x1="140" y1="323" x2="140" y2="18.2" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="140,10.2 144.5,19.2 135.5,19.2" fill="#191714"/><text x="372" y="194" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="end">Re</text><text x="152" y="22.2" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="start">Im</text><line x1="242" y1="34" x2="242" y2="306" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5 5" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="140" y1="170" x2="237.2" y2="299.6" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="242,306 233,301.5 240.2,296.1" fill="#191714"/><line x1="140" y1="170" x2="237.2" y2="40.4" stroke="#d70217" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="242,34 240.2,43.9 233,38.5" fill="#d70217"/><circle cx="242" cy="34" r="5" fill="#d70217"/><circle cx="242" cy="306" r="5" fill="#191714"/><text x="254" y="32" font-size="15" fill="#d70217" text-anchor="start"><tspan font-style="italic">z</tspan> = 3 + 4<tspan font-style="italic">i</tspan></text><text x="254" y="312" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="start">3 − 4<tspan font-style="italic">i</tspan></text><text x="179.2" y="134.6" font-size="15" fill="#177245" text-anchor="start">|<tspan font-style="italic">z</tspan>| = 5</text><text x="231" y="190" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">3</text><text x="132" y="39" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="end">4</text><text x="132" y="311" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="end">−4</text></svg>', '0 0 400 340', 'Комплексная плоскость: горизонтальная ось Re, вертикальная ось Im. Число z = 3 + 4i изображено точкой (3, 4) и стрелкой из начала координат длиной |z| = 5. Число 3 − 4i изображено точкой (3, −4): она симметрична точке (3, 4) относительно действительной оси.', 'Комплекстик тегиздик: горизонталдык Re огу, вертикалдык Im огу. z = 3 + 4i саны (3, 4) чекити жана координаталар башталышынан чыккан |z| = 5 узундуктагы жебе менен көрсөтүлгөн. 3 − 4i саны (3, −4) чекити менен көрсөтүлгөн: ал (3, 4) чекитине чыныгы окко карата симметриялуу.', 'The complex plane with the real axis Re and the imaginary axis Im. The number z = 3 + 4i is the point (3, 4) with an arrow from the origin of length |z| = 5. The number 3 - 4i is the point (3, -4), the mirror image of (3, 4) across the real axis.', 'f60c6fd5635599bbde1a99fca262559caf024172bc70dce602c7926f81b4bc1f'),
  ('38679f35-2d29-5e8d-83d9-6f8c86bc22dc', 'afbc61ca-e798-54ac-8239-1569327cebf1', 'item-space-coords-box', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 312" width="360" height="312" font-family="Golos Text, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif"><title>Box 4 by 6 by 6 with a vertex at the origin and the center M of the top face</title><rect width="360" height="312" rx="12" fill="#ffffff"/><path d="M120,46 L72,82 L252,82 L300,46 Z" fill="none" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="72" y1="262" x2="72" y2="82" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="300" y1="226" x2="300" y2="46" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="252" y1="262" x2="252" y2="82" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="72" y1="262" x2="252" y2="262" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="252" y1="262" x2="300" y2="226" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="120" y1="226" x2="62.4" y2="269.2" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="56.8,273.4 62.6,262.8 68.6,270.8" fill="#191714"/><line x1="120" y1="226" x2="324" y2="226" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="331,226 320,231 320,221" fill="#191714"/><line x1="120" y1="226" x2="120" y2="22" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="120,15 125,26 115,26" fill="#191714"/><line x1="120" y1="46" x2="252" y2="82" stroke="#d70217" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/><line x1="72" y1="82" x2="300" y2="46" stroke="#d70217" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/><circle cx="186" cy="64" r="5" fill="#d70217"/><text x="195" y="55" font-size="16" fill="#d70217" text-anchor="start" font-style="italic">M</text><circle cx="120" cy="226" r="3.5" fill="#191714"/><text x="111" y="219" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="end" font-style="italic">O</text><text x="43.6" y="287.8" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle" font-style="italic">x</text><text x="342" y="231" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle" font-style="italic">y</text><text x="132" y="20" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle" font-style="italic">z</text><circle cx="72" cy="262" r="3.5" fill="#191714"/><text x="68" y="284" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">4</text><circle cx="300" cy="226" r="3.5" fill="#191714"/><text x="310" y="244" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="start">6</text><circle cx="120" cy="46" r="3.5" fill="#191714"/><text x="111" y="51" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="end">6</text></svg>', '0 0 360 312', 'Прямоугольный параллелепипед с вершиной в начале координат O, рёбра идут вдоль осей. Длины рёбер: 4 вдоль оси x, 6 вдоль оси y, 6 вдоль оси z, верхняя грань лежит на высоте 6. Две красные штриховые диагонали верхней грани пересекаются в точке M, центре верхней грани.', 'Чокусу O координаталар башталышында жаткан тик бурчтуу параллелепипед, кырлары октор боюнча багытталган. Кырлардын узундуктары: x огу боюнча 4, y огу боюнча 6, z огу боюнча 6, үстүңкү жак 6 бийиктикте жатат. Үстүңкү жактын эки кызыл штрих диагоналы үстүңкү жактын борбору M чекитинде кесилишет.', 'A rectangular box with a vertex at the origin O and edges along the axes. The edge lengths are 4 along x, 6 along y and 6 along z, so the top face is at height 6. The two red dashed diagonals of the top face meet at M, the center of the top face.', '7bd591278769b7152f123030e1f4625d10b15deb3e461c07f9854a10ba2a0181'),
  ('bb7f46f3-c899-5dab-8340-0c997a2e0de6', 'afbc61ca-e798-54ac-8239-1569327cebf1', 'space-coords-box', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 262" width="360" height="262" font-family="Golos Text, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif"><title>Box with a vertex at the origin and the point A(3, 4, 2)</title><rect width="360" height="262" rx="12" fill="#ffffff"/><path d="M112,88 L56.8,129.4 L240.8,129.4 L296,88 Z" fill="none" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="56.8" y1="221.4" x2="56.8" y2="129.4" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="296" y1="180" x2="296" y2="88" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="240.8" y1="221.4" x2="296" y2="180" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="112" y1="180" x2="41.4" y2="233" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="35.8,237.2 41.6,226.6 47.6,234.6" fill="#191714"/><line x1="112" y1="180" x2="331.4" y2="180" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="338.4,180 327.4,185 327.4,175" fill="#191714"/><line x1="112" y1="180" x2="112" y2="43.4" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="112,36.4 117,47.4 107,47.4" fill="#191714"/><path d="M112,180 L56.8,221.4 L240.8,221.4 L240.8,129.4" fill="none" stroke="#d70217" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="240.8" cy="129.4" r="5" fill="#d70217"/><circle cx="240.8" cy="221.4" r="4" fill="#191714"/><text x="230.8" y="117.4" font-size="15" fill="#d70217" text-anchor="end">A(3, 4, 2)</text><text x="240.8" y="241.4" font-size="14" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">(3, 4, 0)</text><circle cx="56.8" cy="221.4" r="4" fill="#191714"/><text x="24.6" y="248.6" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle" font-style="italic">x</text><text x="349.4" y="185" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle" font-style="italic">y</text><text x="124" y="41.4" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle" font-style="italic">z</text><text x="103" y="173" font-size="15" fill="#191714" text-anchor="end" font-style="italic">O</text><text x="70.8" y="241.4" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">3</text><text x="306" y="198" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="start">4</text><text x="103" y="93" font-size="14" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="end">2</text></svg>', '0 0 360 262', 'Прямоугольный параллелепипед в системе координат: одна вершина в начале координат O, рёбра вдоль осей x, y, z имеют длины 3, 4 и 2. Противоположная вершина A(3, 4, 2) отмечена красной точкой. Красный путь идёт от O на 3 вдоль оси x, затем на 4 вдоль оси y, затем на 2 вверх вдоль оси z. Точка (3, 4, 0) под A лежит в плоскости xOy.', 'Координаталар системасындагы тик бурчтуу параллелепипед: бир чокусу O координаталар башталышында, x, y, z октору боюнча кырларынын узундуктары 3, 4 жана 2. Карама-каршы A(3, 4, 2) чокусу кызыл чекит менен белгиленген. Кызыл жол O дон x огу боюнча 3, анан y огу боюнча 4, анан z огу боюнча 2 жогору барат. A нын астындагы (3, 4, 0) чекити xOy тегиздигинде жатат.', 'A rectangular box in a coordinate system: one vertex at the origin O and edges of length 3, 4 and 2 along the x, y and z axes. The opposite vertex A(3, 4, 2) is a red dot. A red path goes 3 along x, then 4 along y, then 2 up along z. The point (3, 4, 0) below A lies in the xOy plane.', '3ca37f59b6fcb3d29cb0eb9f437d09f9bbd8376a82405114673e79f8a47f79d2'),
  ('6f84ea70-2c1b-509d-8d2d-ea6e49224d52', 'afbc61ca-e798-54ac-8239-1569327cebf1', 'item-solids-triangle', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 262" width="360" height="262" font-family="Golos Text, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif"><title>Right triangle with vertical leg 3 and horizontal leg 4, dashed mirror image across the vertical leg</title><rect width="360" height="262" rx="12" fill="#ffffff"/><path d="M180,96 L20,216 L180,216" fill="none" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/><path d="M180,96 L340,216 L180,216 Z" fill="none" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="180" y1="66" x2="180" y2="96" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/><line x1="180" y1="216" x2="180" y2="238" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/><path d="M192,216 L192,204 L180,204" fill="none" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="180,58 175.5,67 184.5,67" fill="#6b6660"/><text x="170" y="161" font-size="18" fill="#d70217" text-anchor="end" font-weight="600">3</text><text x="260" y="240" font-size="18" fill="#d70217" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">4</text></svg>', '0 0 360 262', 'Прямоугольный треугольник: вертикальный катет длины 3, горизонтальный катет длины 4, прямой угол внизу у вертикального катета. Вертикальный катет лежит на штриховой вертикальной оси вращения. Слева от оси штриховой линией показан зеркальный образ треугольника.', 'Тик бурчтуу үч бурчтук: вертикалдык катеттин узундугу 3, горизонталдык катеттин узундугу 4, тик бурч вертикалдык катеттин астында. Вертикалдык катет штрих вертикалдык айлануу огунда жатат. Огдун сол жагында үч бурчтуктун күзгүдөгү элеси штрих сызык менен көрсөтүлгөн.', 'A right triangle with a vertical leg of length 3 and a horizontal leg of length 4, the right angle at the bottom of the vertical leg. The vertical leg lies on a dashed vertical axis. Left of the axis a dashed line shows the mirror image of the triangle.', '45fd01bb7cdadd3ff51b88a1f0a0099d3ad4586d779c89264c70d6a67d22a4b7'),
  ('3c7d2819-e017-500a-82ef-3be4e582ae54', 'afbc61ca-e798-54ac-8239-1569327cebf1', 'solids-cylinder-cone', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 244" width="360" height="244" font-family="Golos Text, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif"><title>Cylinder with radius r and height h, cone with radius r, height h and slant height l</title><rect width="360" height="244" rx="12" fill="#ffffff"/><line x1="44" y1="62" x2="44" y2="182" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="148" y1="62" x2="148" y2="182" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M148,62 L147.6,64 L146.2,65.9 L144,67.7 L141,69.5 L137.3,71.1 L132.8,72.6 L127.7,73.9 L122,75 L115.9,75.9 L109.5,76.5 L102.8,76.9 L96,77 L89.2,76.9 L82.5,76.5 L76.1,75.9 L70,75 L64.3,73.9 L59.2,72.6 L54.7,71.1 L51,69.5 L48,67.7 L45.8,65.9 L44.4,64 L44,62 L44.4,60 L45.8,58.1 L48,56.3 L51,54.5 L54.7,52.9 L59.2,51.4 L64.3,50.1 L70,49 L76.1,48.1 L82.5,47.5 L89.2,47.1 L96,47 L102.8,47.1 L109.5,47.5 L115.9,48.1 L122,49 L127.7,50.1 L132.8,51.4 L137.3,52.9 L141,54.5 L144,56.3 L146.2,58.1 L147.6,60 L148,62 Z" fill="none" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M148,182 L147.9,183 L147.6,184 L147,184.9 L146.2,185.9 L145.2,186.8 L144,187.7 L142.6,188.6 L141,189.5 L139.2,190.3 L137.3,191.1 L135.1,191.9 L132.8,192.6 L130.3,193.3 L127.7,193.9 L124.9,194.5 L122,195 L119,195.5 L115.9,195.9 L112.7,196.2 L109.5,196.5 L106.1,196.7 L102.8,196.9 L99.4,197 L96,197 L92.6,197 L89.2,196.9 L85.9,196.7 L82.5,196.5 L79.3,196.2 L76.1,195.9 L73,195.5 L70,195 L67.1,194.5 L64.3,193.9 L61.7,193.3 L59.2,192.6 L56.9,191.9 L54.7,191.1 L52.8,190.3 L51,189.5 L49.4,188.6 L48,187.7 L46.8,186.8 L45.8,185.9 L45,184.9 L44.4,184 L44.1,183 L44,182" fill="none" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M44,182 L44.1,181 L44.4,180 L45,179.1 L45.8,178.1 L46.8,177.2 L48,176.3 L49.4,175.4 L