80 L215,179.1 L215.8,178.1 L216.8,177.2 L218,176.3 L219.4,175.4 L221,174.5 L222.8,173.7 L224.7,172.9 L226.9,172.1 L229.2,171.4 L231.7,170.7 L234.3,170.1 L237.1,169.5 L240,169 L243,168.5 L246.1,168.1 L249.3,167.8 L252.5,167.5 L255.9,167.3 L259.2,167.1 L262.6,167 L266,167 L269.4,167 L272.8,167.1 L276.1,167.3 L279.5,167.5 L282.7,167.8 L285.9,168.1 L289,168.5 L292,169 L294.9,169.5 L297.7,170.1 L300.3,170.7 L302.8,171.4 L305.1,172.1 L307.3,172.9 L309.2,173.7 L311,174.5 L312.6,175.4 L314,176.3 L315.2,177.2 L316.2,178.1 L317,179.1 L317.6,180 L317.9,181 L318,182" fill="none" stroke="#191714" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/><line x1="266" y1="40" x2="266" y2="182" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/><line x1="266" y1="182" x2="318" y2="182" stroke="#177245" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="266" cy="182" r="3.5" fill="#191714"/><text x="330" y="188" font-size="16" fill="#177245" text-anchor="start" font-style="italic">r</text><text x="275" y="112" font-size="16" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="start" font-style="italic">h</text><text x="306" y="104" font-size="16" fill="#d70217" text-anchor="start" font-style="italic">l</text></svg>', '0 0 360 244', 'Слева цилиндр: радиус основания r показан зелёным отрезком от центра верхнего основания до края, высота h показана штриховой осью. Справа конус: радиус основания r зелёный, высота h штриховая ось, образующая l красная, от вершины до края основания.', 'Сол жакта цилиндр: негиздин радиусу r үстүңкү негиздин борборунан четине чейинки жашыл кесинди менен, бийиктиги h штрих ок менен көрсөтүлгөн. Оң жакта конус: негиздин радиусу r жашыл, бийиктиги h штрих ок, жасоочусу l кызыл, чокудан негиздин четине чейин.', 'On the left, a cylinder with base radius r (green segment from the center of the top base to its edge) and height h (dashed axis). On the right, a cone with base radius r (green), height h (dashed axis) and slant height l (red, from the apex to the edge of the base).', '29f135dd12c12e35c9eddaf0264857458ac7409407894a31badcd100d5f1b37e'),
  ('336a4eda-1ab9-55d5-8680-8f505a46d85b', 'afbc61ca-e798-54ac-8239-1569327cebf1', 'item-prob-lattice', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 246" width="360" height="246" font-family="Golos Text, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif"><title>Grid of 3 by 2 squares with points A at the lower left, B at the upper right and M inside</title><rect width="360" height="246" rx="12" fill="#ffffff"/><line x1="56" y1="196" x2="56" y2="36" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="136" y1="196" x2="136" y2="36" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="216" y1="196" x2="216" y2="36" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="296" y1="196" x2="296" y2="36" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="56" y1="196" x2="296" y2="196" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="56" y1="116" x2="296" y2="116" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="56" y1="36" x2="296" y2="36" stroke="#6b6660" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="56" cy="196" r="3.5" fill="#191714"/><circle cx="56" cy="116" r="3.5" fill="#191714"/><circle cx="56" cy="36" r="3.5" fill="#191714"/><circle cx="136" cy="196" r="3.5" fill="#191714"/><circle cx="136" cy="116" r="3.5" fill="#191714"/><circle cx="136" cy="36" r="3.5" fill="#191714"/><circle cx="216" cy="196" r="3.5" fill="#191714"/><circle cx="216" cy="116" r="3.5" fill="#191714"/><circle cx="216" cy="36" r="3.5" fill="#191714"/><circle cx="296" cy="196" r="3.5" fill="#191714"/><circle cx="296" cy="116" r="3.5" fill="#191714"/><circle cx="296" cy="36" r="3.5" fill="#191714"/><circle cx="56" cy="196" r="6" fill="#191714"/><circle cx="296" cy="36" r="6" fill="#191714"/><circle cx="136" cy="116" r="7" fill="#d70217"/><text x="42" y="218" font-size="17" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle" font-style="italic">A</text><text x="310" y="24" font-size="17" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle" font-style="italic">B</text><text x="147" y="105" font-size="17" fill="#d70217" text-anchor="start" font-style="italic">M</text></svg>', '0 0 360 246', 'Сетка из 3 клеток по горизонтали и 2 клеток по вертикали. Точка A в левом нижнем углу, точка B в правом верхнем углу. Красная точка M стоит в узле на один шаг правее и на один шаг выше A. Двигаться по линиям сетки можно только вправо и вверх.', 'Туурасынан 3 уяча жана бийиктигинен 2 уяча болгон тор. A чекити сол төмөнкү бурчта, B чекити оң жогорку бурчта. Кызыл M чекити A дан бир кадам оңдо жана бир кадам жогору турган түйүндө жайгашкан. Тордун сызыктары боюнча оңго жана жогору гана жылууга болот.', 'A grid 3 squares wide and 2 squares tall. Point A is at the lower left corner and point B at the upper right corner. The red point M is at the node one step right and one step up from A. Along the grid lines one may move only to the right or up.', '2c038aee76fb1cf6f873ceb5498fe22139d45fe415552b665c32191d440ac14a'),
  ('b855d0bb-0bc3-5e03-8800-46a62bfe3fdb', 'afbc61ca-e798-54ac-8239-1569327cebf1', 'prob-dice-sums', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 326" width="360" height="326" font-family="Golos Text, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif"><title>Table of the sums of two dice, the cells with sum 7 highlighted</title><rect width="360" height="326" rx="12" fill="#ffffff"/><text x="60" y="58" font-size="18" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">+</text><text x="100" y="58" font-size="16" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">1</text><text x="60" y="96" font-size="16" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">1</text><text x="140" y="58" font-size="16" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">2</text><text x="60" y="136" font-size="16" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">2</text><text x="180" y="58" font-size="16" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">3</text><text x="60" y="176" font-size="16" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">3</text><text x="220" y="58" font-size="16" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">4</text><text x="60" y="216" font-size="16" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">4</text><text x="260" y="58" font-size="16" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">5</text><text x="60" y="256" font-size="16" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">5</text><text x="300" y="58" font-size="16" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">6</text><text x="60" y="296" font-size="16" fill="#6b6660" text-anchor="middle">6</text><rect x="80" y="70" width="40" height="40" fill="none" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1"/><text x="100" y="96" font-size="16" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">2</text><rect x="120" y="70" width="40" height="40" fill="none" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1"/><text x="140" y="96" font-size="16" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">3</text><rect x="160" y="70" width="40" height="40" fill="none" stroke="#e4dfd7" stroke-width="1"/><text x="180" y="96" font-size="16" fill="#191714" text-anchor="middle">4</text><rect x="200" y="70" width="40" height="40" fill="n